{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books","id":681474,"title":"Arms, the Realm, & Dragonblooded Books","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-28T16:11:34-07:00","id":681474,"title":"Arms, the Realm, & Dragonblooded Books","content":"So these books have been in Second Draft for what seems like ages now as the developers rightly focused on the mainbook (and wrongly seemed to ignore exalted for ages while writing NWoD stuff). Has anyone heard/seen an ETA on these books? Personally though I love the Solar Exalted, but the Dragonblooded have always been my first love for grand intrigue reasons. I even wrote a conversion of them for Savage Worlds because I hated their incredibly limited charms list but loved the setting and style so much. I'm dying to see the new version of them and hoping to the Immaculate Dragons that they have a robust charm set this time. So.... Whats the word? Is there word at all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6473-raemus","name":"Raemus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6473_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T16:29:02-07:00","id":681527,"title":"","content":"They're hoping to have them out before the end of the year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T18:28:13-07:00","id":681613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681527#post681527\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They're hoping to have them out before the end of the year.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I have heard this as well it seems...kind of ridiculous. Ex3 is coming out mid October at the earliest, and they're going to have an artifact book, a setting book and the second splatbook out in 2 months? I'd be happy if it's the case but it's kind of like if Valve came out tomorrow with an announcement that they've been working on Half Life 3 for the past four months and are happy to announce it's release date of November this year. You'd know it's probably going to be good, and you're not going to blame them for not making that date, but you're also probably going to have a good little chuckle about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T18:42:08-07:00","id":681618,"title":"","content":"How surreal that we have guesstimations on the second splat and a accessory book, but not the core.<br /> <br /> Monday Meeting Notes 12/22: Dragon-Blooded: What Fires have Wrought out now in POD and PDF. Exalted 3e in editing based on CCP's notes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T19:11:38-07:00","id":681658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681613#post681613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> While I have heard this as well it seems...kind of ridiculous. Ex3 is coming out mid October at the earliest, and they're going to have an artifact book, a setting book and the second splatbook out in 2 months? I'd be happy if it's the case but it's kind of like if Valve came out tomorrow with an announcement that they've been working on Half Life 3 for the past four months and are happy to announce it's release date of November this year. You'd know it's probably going to be good, and you're not going to blame them for not making that date, but you're also probably going to have a good little chuckle about it.</div> </div> </div> </div>They've already written most of those books and figured out their layout system. I think the idea is that, once the corebook hits, they can quickly pretty up the draft versions they've had sitting around for ages and then send them right off to CCP.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">My homebrew: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1244979-abyssals-a-shadow-falls\" target=\"_blank\">Abyssals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1065949-infernals-to-rule-in-hell-complete-edition\" target=\"_blank\">Infernals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/781489-ex3-dragon-kings-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Dragon Kings,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1058142-lanaya-s-martial-arts-homebrew-compendium\" target=\"_blank\">martial arts.</a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3559-lanaya","name":"Lanaya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3559_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T19:32:52-07:00","id":681686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lanaya</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681658#post681658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They've already written most of those books and figured out their layout system. I think the idea is that, once the corebook hits, they can quickly pretty up the draft versions they've had sitting around for ages and then send them right off to CCP.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's true, but they still have to do all the layout for them, even if they figured out the system. Remember it took Holden almost 2 weeks just to do the page XX replacements in the core. Plus the DB hardback is getting a kickstarter and those usually take a whole month. Arms, maybe because it's so small, but it took, what? Six months to do all the fine tuning and layout stuff in the core? They're saying they want to do that for three books in two months? Especially with all the family stuff and vacations and things that happen around December time? Hell, flu season is then too, and the whole exalted team seems to have seriously pissed off a few disease gods. Considering all that I think having DBs out by mid spring could be considered ambitious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T19:58:27-07:00","id":681694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681613#post681613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> While I have heard this as well it seems...kind of ridiculous. Ex3 is coming out mid October at the earliest, and they're going to have an artifact book, a setting book and the second splatbook out in 2 months? I'd be happy if it's the case but it's kind of like if Valve came out tomorrow with an announcement that they've been working on Half Life 3 for the past four months and are happy to announce it's release date of November this year. You'd know it's probably going to be good, and you're not going to blame them for not making that date, but you're also probably going to have a good little chuckle about it.</div> </div> </div> </div>QFT.<br /> <br /> For reference, the below represents about three months of the layout process.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">&quot;<span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Nah, not going to jinx it and if I say the name then somebody will think I promised it\u2019ll be out next week. But </span></span><b>EX3</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> is really coming along in layout.</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">.&quot; -- June 29th MMM Notes</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">&quot;RichT here: Page XX page numbers from the Devs sent to Maria. No idea how long it will take for her to input these into an almost 700 pg book. It took me three 12 hours days to do the ones for V20, and we didn\u2019t have as many. After she\u2019s done we submit the whole corrected PDF to CCP again to show we hit their needed correx. And then the backer PDF gets sent out\u2026&quot; -- September 28th MMM Notes</span></span></span><br /> <br /> So, we went from &quot;It''s in layout&quot; to...It's still in layout. That time was spent doing things like setting up sidebars and stat blocks, two trips to CCP (IIRC), and a ton of other things that will have to happen again. Hell, it took two weeks to get the XX's done, and they still aren't in the draft. This is not the kind of work that can be templated and re-used, so unless the quality of Dragon-Blooded is significantly lower, no way in Malfeas it's out before year end.<br /> <br /> I will youtube myself eating the cover off a 1E Caste book if it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6601-totentanz","name":"Totentanz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T20:06:38-07:00","id":681699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Totentanz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681694#post681694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will youtube myself eating the cover off a 1E Caste book if it is.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh come on now, that's like saying &quot;If the sun rises tomorrow covered by the image of Prime Minister John A Macdonald giving double finger pistols and winking then I'll eat my shoe.&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> <br /> Honestly considering the Christmas season it's less like 2 months and more like 1.5, assuming ex3 comes out mid-late October. At that point it wouldn't even be a good business decision to have a kickstarter and 3 books launch, even if you could. Having a better paced product launch cycle is better for most people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T20:13:44-07:00","id":681705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raemus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books#post681474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... (and wrongly seemed to ignore exalted for ages while writing NWoD stuff). ...</div> </div> </div> </div>Kind of curious where you got this impression. As far as I can tell, no one writing for Exalted currently is writing for anything WoD unless I missed something.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T20:21:21-07:00","id":681714,"title":"","content":"Holden did some Werewolf 20th anniversary stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T20:57:02-07:00","id":681722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681714#post681714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Holden did some Werewolf 20th anniversary stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's why I note currently. I know he had previously worked on W20 but that was what? A year or two ago? And still nothing related to the nWoD, as the OP seemed to imply was taking resources from Exalted somehow.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T21:00:30-07:00","id":681724,"title":"","content":"The latest thread summaries from RPG.net (and we owe Minton for that; I used to spend a lot of time there but not so much anymore and sifting those threads is a pain) have Holden saying that the plan at least was to have the first supplement come roaring out hot on the heels of the big release. So there's that.<br /> <br /> I think it might be time for some historical perspective on this, with the caveat that Onyx Path is not White Wolf and that this information is between ten and fifteen years old.<br /> <br /> Wikipedia has an excellently complete list of all Exalted publications <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Exalted_publications\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. Disregarding the Storyteller's Companions, lets see what the first two editions managed in their first two to three months of release, and how quick they got their first fatsplats out. I will summarize.<br /> <br /> The 1e Corebook dropped in August '01, at GenCon if I'm remembering properly. 1e actually managed to drop Scavenger Sons almost simultaneous with the Corebook and got Book of Three Circles and a Caste Book out within two months. After that things slowed down, likely due to holidays and due to the fact they were probably waiting to see if this new, untried property would catch on. (I also wonder how, if at all, 9/11 impacted the development cycle.) The Dragon-Blooded fatsplat took eight whole months to hit and people were really champing for it by the time it arrived.<br /> <br /> (Sidebar: 1e Dragon-Blooded was deeply infamous for having really, really shitty binding; many if not mos peoples copies fell apart on them to a greater or lesser extent.)<br /> <br /> So that was 1e.<br /> <br /> The 2e core hit in March of '06. Between then and July we got Wonders of the Lost Age, Compass: Scavenger Lands, and MoEP: Dragon-Blooded. The release curve generally looks smoother.<br /> <br /> For both editions they got their second fatsplat out a little over a year after the core, and in both cases it was Lunars.<br /> <br /> So that was the prior editions.<br /> <br /> What has me slightly perturbed is that, while those are very acceptable release schedules post-launch, and the overall schedules were deeply aggressive (there were long stretches of time where you could count on a new Exalted thinsplat every six weeks or so) the devs have talked a lot about how for the big books, especially in 2e, they were hampered by needing to pull the trigger on stuff that was obviously not ready to go out the door for scheduling reasons. And that was in the White Wolf days, when they had all the publishing muscle of a decade-old publishing house that was known for the wild success of its lines behind them. We now have none of that. This is good from the perspective that CCP is unlikely to ever demand Onyx Path kick something out the door to meet an arbitrary release date... but it also probably means that 3e is going to have a much <i>less</i> aggressive release schedule than both prior editions did, which means the big anchoring fatsplats seem likely to have long, long waits between them. I personally doubt we're going to see Lunars anytime before mid-2017, as they've got to get Dragon-Blooded AND Exigents out before'em, and Exigents are completely uncharted territory.<br /> <br /> It does mean when we do get them, they'll be done <i>right</i>, or at least if they're done badly it won't be for lack of time spent. But I'd prep for more of these long, agonizing waits.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;SEX NOVA is the kind of person who, after being chosen as the divine champion of the god of heroes, decided to call himself SEX NOVA.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4742-murcushio","name":"Murcushio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4742_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1249"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T22:19:15-07:00","id":681767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681724#post681724\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Sidebar: 1e Dragon-Blooded was deeply infamous for having really, really shitty binding; many if not mos peoples copies fell apart on them to a greater or lesser extent.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, how funny. I got rid of my books about two years ago: the Dragon-Blooded one was loose but didn't fall apart. If I had known, I might have hit up my fellow Exalted peeps and shipped it to someone who's book died on them.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T23:28:55-07:00","id":681819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681724#post681724\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The latest thread summaries from RPG.net (and we owe Minton for that; I used to spend a lot of time there but not so much anymore and sifting those threads is a pain) have Holden saying that the plan at least was to have the first supplement come roaring out hot on the heels of the big release. So there's that.<br /> <br /> I think it might be time for some historical perspective on this, with the caveat that Onyx Path is not White Wolf and that this information is between ten and fifteen years old.<br /> <br /> Wikipedia has an excellently complete list of all Exalted publications <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Exalted_publications\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. Disregarding the Storyteller's Companions, lets see what the first two editions managed in their first two to three months of release, and how quick they got their first fatsplats out. I will summarize.<br /> <br /> The 1e Corebook dropped in August '01, at GenCon if I'm remembering properly. 1e actually managed to drop Scavenger Sons almost simultaneous with the Corebook and got Book of Three Circles and a Caste Book out within two months. After that things slowed down, likely due to holidays and due to the fact they were probably waiting to see if this new, untried property would catch on. (I also wonder how, if at all, 9/11 impacted the development cycle.) The Dragon-Blooded fatsplat took eight whole months to hit and people were really champing for it by the time it arrived.<br /> <br /> (Sidebar: 1e Dragon-Blooded was deeply infamous for having really, really shitty binding; many if not mos peoples copies fell apart on them to a greater or lesser extent.)<br /> <br /> So that was 1e.<br /> <br /> The 2e core hit in March of '06. Between then and July we got Wonders of the Lost Age, Compass: Scavenger Lands, and MoEP: Dragon-Blooded. The release curve generally looks smoother.<br /> <br /> For both editions they got their second fatsplat out a little over a year after the core, and in both cases it was Lunars.<br /> <br /> So that was the prior editions.<br /> <br /> What has me slightly perturbed is that, while those are very acceptable release schedules post-launch, and the overall schedules were deeply aggressive (there were long stretches of time where you could count on a new Exalted thinsplat every six weeks or so) the devs have talked a lot about how for the big books, especially in 2e, they were hampered by needing to pull the trigger on stuff that was obviously not ready to go out the door for scheduling reasons. And that was in the White Wolf days, when they had all the publishing muscle of a decade-old publishing house that was known for the wild success of its lines behind them. We now have none of that. This is good from the perspective that CCP is unlikely to ever demand Onyx Path kick something out the door to meet an arbitrary release date... but it also probably means that 3e is going to have a much <i>less</i> aggressive release schedule than both prior editions did, which means the big anchoring fatsplats seem likely to have long, long waits between them. I personally doubt we're going to see Lunars anytime before mid-2017, as they've got to get Dragon-Blooded AND Exigents out before'em, and Exigents are completely uncharted territory.<br /> <br /> It does mean when we do get them, they'll be done <i>right</i>, or at least if they're done badly it won't be for lack of time spent. But I'd prep for more of these long, agonizing waits.<br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with your rebuttal up to the part where you said that Onyx Path Publishing has none of that same respect.<br /> <br /> So they don't have three 20th Anniversary titles out now? So they don't have Demon, which for its flaws sold fairly well? For all the complaining people are doing, they sure love to support the company. It's not like they're completely unproven. Have they messed up? Sure they have. (Mummy. Just. Mummy. Demon, too in different ways.) Even the title I would say is their lowest quality release currently out has sold respectfully well for the figures this business and has a serious fan components.<br /> <br /> I would also like to point out that <i>isn't OPP run by one of the original WW devs?</i> Isn't that credibility enough?<br /> <br /> Also, wasn't White Wolf having problems that required a rescue from CCP's purchase and OPP's licensing deal?<br /> <br /> So yeah, I'd be more prepared to give OPP some actual credit, as the folks in charge has given Ex3 the time to mature and come out as a completely amazing product. Will it have flaws? Certainly. Has it been a lot longer than people thought? Certainly! Did shit happen to explain this long wait? Sure the heck did. Might I be talking out of my ass? Sure I could!<br /> <br /> OPP is trying new things, now as well as revitalizing the properties they have. Given the resonance with people that World of Darkness and Exalted still have, they're supporting and believing in the developers. They have stated before that once the Core drops, the splats and such are <i>going to come very fast</i>. They wanted to take their time to get this right.<br /> <br /> And I believe they will. Will it be perfect? Probably not-but do not let perfect be the enemy of <i>damn good, son.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1148,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","user":"Palemask","date":".  formatting 09-29-2015, 02:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T02:54:20-07:00","id":681880,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681686#post681686\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Remember it took Holden almost 2 weeks just to do the page XX replacements in the core.</div> </div> </div> </div>So scale that down to a book that is not even half as long and doesn't have to elaborate on its entirely new system.<br /> <br /> Do you think The Realm will have even a <i>single</i> internal page reference?<br /> <br /> (I'm being hyperbolic, of course setting books still have page references, but you should take my point; the difference between the core book of the new Edition with the entirely new, custom designed system, and its early sourcebooks is fricking <i>quadratic</i> if you actually stop and think about it)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T03:23:27-07:00","id":681891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681880#post681880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So scale that down to a book that is not even half as long and doesn't have to elaborate on its entirely new system.<br /> <br /> Do you think The Realm will have even a <i>single</i> internal page reference?<br /> <br /> (I'm being hyperbolic, of course setting books still have page references, but you should take my point; the difference between the core book of the new Edition with the entirely new, custom designed system, and its early sourcebooks is fricking <i>quadratic</i> if you actually stop and think about it)</div> </div> </div> </div>And he probably won't be sick when he does it either, my point was mostly things that you think/should take two days can end up taking 12.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T03:38:40-07:00","id":681896,"title":"","content":"Just to be clear, my statement was not intended to rag on OPP for their scheduling or anything. Even if they sent out backer PDFs tomorrow, that would still be a month before they could call it done and put the book up for PoD. From there, they would have two months to go through the layout process for a fatsplat, which has taken months for Ex3. That just isn't realistic, unless Dragon-Blooded is already in stealth layout.<br /> <br /> It's going to take months, realistically, to pore over Ex3 and find all the nooks and crannies. We are all gonna post home-made Charms and hacks for systems we don't like, and argue endlessly about individual sentences. It's gonna be a ton of fun. <br /> <br /> We really don't NEED Dragon-Blooded within two months.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6601-totentanz","name":"Totentanz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T03:59:54-07:00","id":681904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Totentanz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681896#post681896\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just to be clear, my statement was not intended to rag on OPP for their scheduling or anything. Even if they sent out backer PDFs tomorrow, that would still be a month before they could call it done and put the book up for PoD. From there, they would have two months to go through the layout process for a fatsplat, which has taken months for Ex3. That just isn't realistic, unless Dragon-Blooded is already in stealth layout.<br /> <br /> It's going to take months, realistically, to pore over Ex3 and find all the nooks and crannies. We are all gonna post home-made Charms and hacks for systems we don't like, and argue endlessly about individual sentences. It's gonna be a ton of fun.<br /> <br /> We really don't NEED Dragon-Blooded within two months.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed, no company in the world could get it done, not ragging on OPP.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T04:34:00-07:00","id":681922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Palemask</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681819#post681819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree with your rebuttal up to the part where you said that Onyx Path Publishing has none of that same respect.</div> </div> </div> </div>... I said <i>no such thing</i> and I challenge you to find where I did.<br /> <br /> What I said &quot;And that was in the White Wolf days, when they had all the publishing <i>muscle</i> (emphasis mine) of a decade-old publishing house that was known for the wild success of its lines behind them.&quot;<br /> <br /> What that statement was meant to say is &quot;OPP manifestly does not have the same resources in staffing and money that White Wolf did.&quot;<br /> <br /> That is both 1) obviously true, and 2) <i>not a value judgment.</i><br /> <br /> Your full-throated defense of OPP would have been very compelling... had it been in response to an actual attack on their skill and dedication.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;SEX NOVA is the kind of person who, after being chosen as the divine champion of the god of heroes, decided to call himself SEX NOVA.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4742-murcushio","name":"Murcushio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4742_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1249"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T05:23:01-07:00","id":681946,"title":"","content":"I seem to recall something about the plan for the What Fire Has Wrought kickstarter. The book will already be done, and the backer PDF will be released as soon as pledges close. <br /> <br /> As long as they keep to this plan I will back it whenever it is launched.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T05:32:26-07:00","id":681954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681946#post681946\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I seem to recall something about the plan for the What Fire Has Wrought kickstarter. The book will already be done, and the backer PDF will be released as soon as pledges close.<br /> <br /> As long as they keep to this plan I will back it whenever it is launched.</div> </div> </div> </div>Quoth Holden on the RPGnet &quot;Ask the Devs&quot; thread:<br /> <br /> <i>The plan is to have the DB book well into layout before starting its Kickstarter, though, so we can do lots of \u201cfinished\u201d excerpts complete with art and everything, and then release the PDF close on the heels of the KS finishing\u2013 the day after it closes, if I had my druthers, although that\u2019s rarely the sort of thing you can guarantee in a hobby where just one artist flaking out can fuck the schedule by two months or more</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T05:34:06-07:00","id":681955,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681954#post681954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Quoth Holden on the RPGnet &quot;Ask the Devs&quot; thread:<br /> <br /> <i>The plan is to have the DB book well into layout before starting its Kickstarter, though, so we can do lots of \u201cfinished\u201d excerpts complete with art and everything, and then release the PDF close on the heels of the KS finishing\u2013 the day after it closes, if I had my druthers, although that\u2019s rarely the sort of thing you can guarantee in a hobby where just one artist flaking out can fuck the schedule by two months or more</i></div> </div> </div> </div>That seems like something that can be declared during the Kickstarter itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T05:53:46-07:00","id":681972,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681954#post681954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">although that\u2019s rarely the sort of thing you can guarantee in a hobby where just one artist flaking out can fuck the schedule by two months or more[/I]</div> </div> </div> </div>Obligatory reminder of the Nobilis fiasco. Although I suppose that didn't actually <i>delay</i> launch, it just royally fucked over Jenna Moran after it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;SEX NOVA is the kind of person who, after being chosen as the divine champion of the god of heroes, decided to call himself SEX NOVA.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4742-murcushio","name":"Murcushio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4742_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1249"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T05:55:54-07:00","id":681975,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Totentanz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681896#post681896\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just to be clear, my statement was not intended to rag on OPP for their scheduling or anything. Even if they sent out backer PDFs tomorrow, that would still be a month before they could call it done and put the book up for PoD. From there, they would have two months to go through the layout process for a fatsplat, which has taken months for Ex3. That just isn't realistic, unless Dragon-Blooded is already in stealth layout.</div> </div> </div> </div>Using the core book's layout time as any kind of standard is <i>really</i> not useful. Remember, a huge part of the reason for the length, aside from the sheer size and complexity, was nailing down templates, formats, standards, etc. that can be used for the rest of the edition. Those are done now. Not gonna pretend it's an overnight process, but it's much going to be much shorter than the core for reasons beyond page length. If the plan is to drop the book very shortly after the Kickstarter, layout can have some overlap with that month.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> We really don't NEED Dragon-Blooded within two months. </div> </div> </div>Playing Malfeas's advocate for a moment, they may disagree. Holden noted their frustration that the leak(s) robbed them of the ability to control hype development. I have no idea if releasing rather a lot of content in very short order is the best way to do that, but I can see a case for it being more valuable than it looks. IF that's their plan, they've got between them a hell of a lot more experience than my little nil; I'd not really be in a legitimate position to criticize.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T06:58:41-07:00","id":682003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gaius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681975#post681975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Holden noted their frustration that the leak(s) robbed them of the ability to control hype development. I have no idea if releasing rather a lot of content in very short order is the best way to do that, but I can see a case for it being more valuable than it looks.</div> </div> </div> </div>For someone not sold on Exalted (which is hard to imagine as deep into these forums as many of us are) when comparing other lines with multiple books, having at least a few books past core is probably a differential selling point. Settings with current editions having 50 some expansions vs. a single core book may feel like there's less to explore - wouldn't want anyone to get that impression about Exalted! <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T07:12:24-07:00","id":682011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Totentanz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681896#post681896\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We really don't NEED Dragon-Blooded within two months.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not so sure. Yes, &quot;we&quot;, the rabid fans still running more or less strong on enthusiasm after all this time probably don't need that. But what about the people who have turned away from Exalted because of the delay, who continue to refer to it as &quot;vaporware&quot;, who are not willing to give OP the benefit of the doubt anymore? We don't really know how big that crowd really is, because for obvious reasons they are less vocal here than those who haven't &quot;lost their faith&quot;, but to get those people back into the fold, yes, actually, they actually might need to get those first books out relatively fast, to show that the delay of the core book is NOT a sign of things to come but a singular event that will not repeat itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2219-delta","name":"Delta","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T10:13:21-07:00","id":682193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681922#post681922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ... I said <i>no such thing</i> and I challenge you to find where I did.<br /> <br /> What I said &quot;And that was in the White Wolf days, when they had all the publishing <i>muscle</i> (emphasis mine) of a decade-old publishing house that was known for the wild success of its lines behind them.&quot;<br /> <br /> What that statement was meant to say is &quot;OPP manifestly does not have the same resources in staffing and money that White Wolf did.&quot;<br /> <br /> That is both 1) obviously true, and 2) <i>not a value judgment.</i><br /> <br /> Your full-throated defense of OPP would have been very compelling... had it been in response to an actual attack on their skill and dedication.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>And that was in the White Wolf days, when they had all the publishing muscle of a decade-old publishing house that was known for the wild success of its lines behind them. <b>We now have none of that</b>.</i></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Except you did. You seem reasonable, don't shift goalposts like that, it's an insult to both our intelligences.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">So scale that down to a book that is not even half as long and doesn't have to elaborate on its entirely new system.</div> </div> </div> </div>What, precisely are you smoking? It must be some seriously good shit since you're suggesting something this infuriatingly useless and insipid.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T10:21:44-07:00","id":682194,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raemus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books#post681474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(and wrongly seemed to ignore exalted for ages while writing NWoD stuff).</div> </div> </div> </div>What<br /> <br /> Yes how terrible if writers picked up other paying contracts while this whale of a book was being edited or playtested or the rules were being revised yet again, considering they won't get paid for it until it drops. <br /> <br /> Seriously though, what even, this sentiment comes across as just ridiculously entitlement. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raemus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books#post681474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone heard/seen an ETA on these books?</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering the fiascos with the 3e core release dates I wouldn't expect anything more specific than a given quarter, if that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T10:30:47-07:00","id":682202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Palemask</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=682193#post682193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Except you did. You seem reasonable, don't shift goalposts like that, it's an insult to both our intelligences.</div> </div> </div> </div>I... what?<br /> <br /> You quoted the part where I say that OPP no longer has the muscle behind it White Wolf used to. I... did say that, yes. I did not say, nor did I imply that Onyx Path doesn't have any of the respect White Wolf had. They may not, but I don't actually know enough about that comment on it.<br /> <br /> You seem very invested in my having taken a swipe at OPP despite the fact that I didn't do that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;SEX NOVA is the kind of person who, after being chosen as the divine champion of the god of heroes, decided to call himself SEX NOVA.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4742-murcushio","name":"Murcushio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4742_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1249"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T13:42:55-07:00","id":682325,"title":"","content":"Dragon-Blooded are my favorite peeps after Solars, so I'd be thrilled if I got Exalted 3e Core and the Dragon-Blooded book within a few months of one another.<br /> <br /> If the writing and editing for DB is almost finished and Maria can immediately jump from layout of 3e to art+layout of the second book, and they begin a Kickstarter right after the core drops, it's possible. It sounds optimistic to me. I see three or four months being a more plausible.<br /> <br /> I don't think I'll sweat it either way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T14:40:35-07:00","id":682357,"title":"","content":"I think the confusion is coming from here:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=681922#post681922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What I said &quot;And that was in the White Wolf days, when they had all the publishing <i>muscle</i> (emphasis mine) of a decade-old publishing house <b>that was known for the wild success of its lines behind them.</b>&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Emphasis in bold, which was then followed up with &quot;We now have none of that,&quot; which I guess can be interpreted to also apply to the area I emphasized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/214-brontes","name":"Brontes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T02:33:46-07:00","id":682851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Palemask</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/681474-arms-the-realm-dragonblooded-books?p=682193#post682193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> [/I]<br /> <br /> Except you did. You seem reasonable, don't shift goalposts like that, it's an insult to both our intelligences.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> What, precisely are you smoking? It must be some seriously good shit since you're suggesting something this infuriatingly useless and insipid.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>This is no way to talk to other forum users. Consider this a formal warning. </b></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T02:41:56-07:00","id":682857,"title":"","content":"Fuck that noise. Exigents Exigents Exigents, all aboard the hype-train. Choo choo, motherfuckers!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}